@startuml
title Start Simulation and Open Dashboard

actor Operator
participant SimulationConfigView
participant SimulationService
participant DefaultSimulationService
participant SpaceFlightApp
participant AppContext
participant FlightSimulationService
participant VitalSignsGenerator
participant PassengerRegistry
participant MainWindow

Operator -> SimulationConfigView : click Start
SimulationConfigView -> SimulationConfigView : buildConfig()
SimulationConfigView -> SimulationService : start(config)
SimulationService -> DefaultSimulationService : start(config)
DefaultSimulationService -> DefaultSimulationService : reset tick state\ncreate Timeline\nplay()

SimulationConfigView -> SpaceFlightApp : onSimulationStarted.accept(config)
SpaceFlightApp -> SpaceFlightApp : openDashboard(config)

SpaceFlightApp -> AppContext : getSimulationService()
AppContext --> SpaceFlightApp : simSvc
SpaceFlightApp -> AppContext : getFlightSimulationService()
AppContext --> SpaceFlightApp : flightSvc
SpaceFlightApp -> AppContext : getVitalSignsGenerator()
AppContext --> SpaceFlightApp : vitalGen
SpaceFlightApp -> AppContext : getPassengerRegistry()
AppContext --> SpaceFlightApp : registry

SpaceFlightApp -> VitalSignsGenerator : configure(tickIntervalMs)
SpaceFlightApp -> PassengerRegistry : getAllPersons()
PassengerRegistry --> SpaceFlightApp : passengers
SpaceFlightApp -> VitalSignsGenerator : markAsEmergency(name, totalTicks)
SpaceFlightApp -> MainWindow : registerView(...)
SpaceFlightApp -> MainWindow : showView(BASE_STATION)
SpaceFlightApp -> SimulationService : addTickListener(listener)

note right of SpaceFlightApp
At this point the dashboard is open and
the simulation clock is running.
Real work begins on each tick.
end note

@enduml
